# -----------------------------------------------------------------
# Environment variables for the Voice Assistant project
# -----------------------------------------------------------------
# HOW TO USE:
#   1. Copy this file and rename the copy to ".env"
#   2. Fill in your real values below (leave the current values if
#      you don't want a feature yet - the assistant will just tell
#      you that feature needs a key when you try to use it)
#   3. Never commit your real .env file to GitHub - it's already
#      listed in .gitignore
# -----------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Weather feature (features/weather.py) ---
# Get a free key at: https://openweathermap.org/api
# (Sign up -> API keys tab -> copy the default key)
OPENWEATHER_API_KEY=your_openweathermap_api_key_here

# --- Email feature (features/email_sender.py) ---
# Use a TEST/DUMMY Gmail account, not your personal one.
# EMAIL_APP_PASSWORD is a 16-character "App Password", NOT your normal
# Gmail login password. Generate one at:
#   https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# (requires 2-Step Verification to be turned on for that Google account)
EMAIL_ADDRESS=your_test_email@gmail.com
EMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=your_16_char_app_password_here
